{
  "_help": "App Store screenshots = one panoramic banner of 4 shots (compose.swift). args = app launch arguments (DEBUG scenes); -language <code> is added per language. headline/accent per app language (\\n = line break; accent = highlighted part, must occur in the headline). locales: App Store locale folder → app language. cards (optional): pop-out mission cards drawn next to the phone; key = English string in App/Localizable.xcstrings (translated per language).",
